### Implemented
**Surrak and Goreclaw** `{4}{G}{G}` 6/5 Legendary Human Bear, exact MOM 337 source.
- Printed trample plus typed static **other creatures you control have trample**, read by real combat damage assignment.
- “Another nontoken creature you control enters” captures the entered object as a non-target `affected` identity; no target prompt.
- Adds exactly one +1/+1 counter and grants `ContinuousKind::GrantsHaste` until cleanup.
- Haste is honored by attack legality and tap-cost summoning-sickness checks.
- Battlefield departure prunes queued/stack `affected` references, so a bounced/recast same ObjectId cannot inherit the old trigger buff.
- Trigger/stack fields are serde-default/skipped; no new GameState field or AI policy change.

